				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c62fccf-7595-5cd9-a26c-6216092b7fc9")
	)
	(text "NFC tag: ST25DV04KC + printed 13.56 MHz coil (D-030)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.09 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0f43f4cc-1817-5acf-aca9-ed2b901cf9e2")
	)
	(text "Qwiic pinout: 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL.  2.2k pull-ups: window 967-3541 Ohm, Fast mode, C_b 100 pF (SLVA689A).\nU801 ESD at the connector.  U802 M24C64-R at 0x50: E2..E0 low, WC low = writes enabled (D-031)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 186.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1c699944-3435-5aaa-80bc-6a86b97858ee")
	)
	(text "ST25DV04KC: ISO 15693 / NFC Type 5 tag on I2C3 (0x53 user, 0x57 system); V_EH unused; GPO open drain -> PA2 (EXTI2).\nAE801: 10 turns, 25 x 21 mm, 4.25 uH; f0 14.2 MHz with C_TUN 28.5 pF + 1 pF (scripts/nfc_coil.py, docs/nfc.md).\nC804 2.7 pF DNP across AC0-AC1 trims f0 to 13.56 MHz: fit after a phone / VNA check.  Keep metal off the coil."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39d0d795-a002-5820-a458-8d0fe9436ed4")
	)
	(text "10k pull-up, 100 Ohm series, 100 nF at the MCU:\ntau 1 ms (mcu-circuit-design s11).  Arm / disarm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "534d6b9f-d67a-524e-a198-57db603f8858")
	)
